| Dataset | Batch_Size | Learning_Rate | Dropout | RT_Loss_Weight | Triplet_Weight | Triplet_Margin | LoRA_Rank | LoRA_Alpha | LoRA_Dropout |
|---------|-----------:|--------------:|--------:|---------------:|---------------:|---------------:|----------:|-----------:|-------------:|
| BPI2012      | 128 | 1e-3 | 0.20 | 1.0 | 0.10 | 1.0 | N/A | N/A | N/A |
| BPI2017      | 256 | 2e-3 | 0.15 | 1.0 | 0.05 | 1.0 | 16  | 32  | 0.10 |
| BPI2015_1    | 32  | 5e-4 | 0.30 | 1.0 | 0.20 | 2.0 | 32  | 64  | 0.10 |
| BPI2015_2    | 32  | 5e-4 | 0.30 | 1.0 | 0.20 | 2.0 | 8   | 16  | 0.15 |
| BPI2015_3    | 32  | 5e-4 | 0.30 | 1.0 | 0.20 | 2.0 | 8   | 16  | 0.15 |
| BPI2015_4    | 32  | 5e-4 | 0.30 | 1.0 | 0.20 | 2.0 | 8   | 16  | 0.15 |
| BPI2015_5    | 32  | 5e-4 | 0.30 | 1.0 | 0.20 | 2.0 | 8   | 16  | 0.15 |
| BPI2020_DD   | 64  | 5e-4 | 0.25 | 2.0 | 0.20 | 1.5 | 8   | 16  | 0.15 |
| BPI2020_ID   | 64  | 5e-4 | 0.25 | 2.0 | 0.20 | 1.5 | 8   | 16  | 0.15 |
| BPI2020_PTC  | 32  | 1e-4 | 0.30 | 2.0 | 0.20 | 1.5 | N/A | N/A | N/A |
| BPI2020_RFP  | 32  | 1e-4 | 0.30 | 2.0 | 0.20 | 1.5 | 8   | 16  | 0.15 |

