## Datasets

| Code | Dataset |
|------|---------|
| BPI2012      | BPI Challenge 2012 — loan application process. |
| BPI2017      | BPI Challenge 2017 — loan application updated process |
| BPI2015_1…5  | BPI Challenge 2015 — building-permit logs, five municipalities. |
| BPI2020_DD   | BPI Challenge 2020 — Domestic Declarations. |
| BPI2020_ID   | BPI Challenge 2020 — International Declarations. |
| BPI2020_PTC  | BPI Challenge 2020 — Prepaid Travel Cost. |
| BPI2020_RFP  | BPI Challenge 2020 — Request For Payment. |
